            "review_title": "Review at Hon Ru Ri Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Vasco M\n1 contribution\n0\nMe and my wife were just greated\nJun 2020\nMe and my wife were just greated by the absolute rudest waiter I have ever come across in my life. As soon as she looked at me the look of desgust on her face was enough to make want to leave immediately. Still I smiled and asked if we could have a table outside. The place was not even close to being full and I could see clearly empty tables. She said NO. Only inside. Naturally we left never to go back. I also saw Asian coupled arriving immediately after while we still in shock greeted with a very different treatment. We are not asian maybe that was why. I cannot possibly recommend this experience. Shameful.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 13, 2020",
